        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CI-GRAPEVINE Cast Iron Grape Vine Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Grape Vine door pull from the new <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=214719\">Nature Collection by First Impressions</a>. It is really more of a door decoration than a door pull. Made from heavy Cast Iron and finished in your choice of ultra durable Powder Coated colors.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Powder Coated finish is very resistant to peeling, fading,  scratching and requires no maintenance to retain its beauty.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUse this Grape Vine door pull on cabinets, pantry room doors,  armoires, almost any door. You could just mount it to the wall for decoration with the optional surface mounting kit if desired. Use your imagination and have fun!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions CI-GRAPEVINE  Grape Vine Door Pull \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Iron</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 3</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional Surface mounting or Glass Door mounting kits (for glass door up to 1/2\" thick, includes  2 inside screw covers).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
